pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: deco-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 58, 4, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [96, 50, 1100, 48]
    content:
      style: "$heading"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>财务预测：三年营收从800万到8500万，毛利率提升至78%</p>
  - elementId: fin-chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [80, 120, 1120, 340]
    type: combo
    data:
      - {year: "第1年", revenue: 800, profit: 120, margin: 0.70}
      - {year: "第2年", revenue: 3500, profit: 1050, margin: 0.75}
      - {year: "第3年", revenue: 8500, profit: 2975, margin: 0.78}
    x: year
    y: [revenue, profit, margin]
    names: ["营业收入(万元)", "净利润(万元)", "毛利率"]
    colors: ["#FF112D", "#FFFFFF", "#FF8A95"]
    seriesStyle:
      revenue: {type: bar}
      profit: {type: bar}
      margin: {type: line, axis: secondary, smooth: true, width: 3}
    yAxis: {title: "金额(万元)", numberFormat: "#,##0", gridLine: {style: solid, color: "#333333", width: 1}}
    secondaryAxis: {title: "毛利率", numberFormat: "0%", min: 0.5, max: 1.0}
    legend: {show: true, position: top, color: "$secondary", fontSize: 12}
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$card"
  - elementId: kpi-row1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 480, 280, 50]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      fontSize: 40
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>5000<span style="font-size:20px;">万</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi-row1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 534, 280, 24]
    content:
      style: "$kpiLabel"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>第1年平台交易额</p>
  - elementId: kpi-row2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [380, 480, 280, 50]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      fontSize: 40
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>25000<span style="font-size:20px;">万</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi-row2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [380, 534, 280, 24]
    content:
      style: "$kpiLabel"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>第2年平台交易额</p>
  - elementId: kpi-row3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 480, 280, 50]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      fontSize: 40
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>50000<span style="font-size:20px;">万</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi-row3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [680, 534, 280, 24]
    content:
      style: "$kpiLabel"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>第3年平台交易额</p>
  - elementId: kpi-row4-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [980, 480, 280, 50]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      fontSize: 40
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>220<span style="font-size:20px;">家</span></p>
  - elementId: kpi-row4-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [980, 534, 280, 24]
    content:
      style: "$kpiLabel"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>第3年加盟节点数量</p>
  - elementId: note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 580, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Liter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>第1年重点拓展节点与用户，实现初步盈利；第2年进入快速增长期，交易额与收入随节点和用户数量同步爆发；第3年形成规模效应，增值服务占比提升，盈利能力持续增强。</p>
  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 680, 1120, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$border"}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 690, 60, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>16</p>
